    3.01e-08 -0.4 3.1e-08 -0.4 3.11e-08 -1.2 3.2e-08 -1.2 ]
Vbi (bi 0) vsource dc=4
Vbq (bq 0) vsource dc=4
Vbp (bp 0) vsource dc=2
X3 (a_re a_im s_re s_im vi vq bi bq bp) mwp_iqm vpi=4
X4 (s_re s_im l_re l_im c_re c_im d_re d_im) mwp_coupler
Vk (k 0) vsource dc=3
X5 (c_re c_im an k) mwp_pd resp=0.8
Vs (an 0) vsource dc=0
save Vs:p
tr tran stop=32e-9 maxstep=1.5625e-12 strobeperiod=1.5625e-12
